Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:07.11,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你看起来还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:07.11,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You look like you're doing all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.93,0:02:12.07,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}时光老人对我们各有安排
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.93,0:02:12.07,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Father Time has his way with us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:15.92,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你看起来到像是惹毛他了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:15.92,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Looks like you must have pissed him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:26.93,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们来这里要干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:26.93,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.93,0:02:30.25,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我对州警察部门
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.93,0:02:30.25,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I got a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:32.60,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}在问的事有点想法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:32.60,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}the State PD's asking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.87,0:02:34.82,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}查尔斯湖谋杀案
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.87,0:02:34.82,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}The Lake Charles murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:37.64,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}都这个时候了 不是应该
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:37.64,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I mean, shouldn't it have been in the paper
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:39.60,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}已经结案了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:39.60,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}to draw a line somewhere by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:43.56,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们不能相信他们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:43.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I mean, we can't trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.56,0:02:45.87,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}如果他们连这种事都想掩盖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.56,0:02:45.87,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And, I mean, if they're gonna cover something like that up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:47.64,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}谁知道他们还掩盖了什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:47.64,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}who knows what else they've covered up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:49.61,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你怎么认为?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:49.61,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}What you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:53.93,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我认为你看起来不太对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:53.93,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I think you don't look particularly healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:56.36,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你的说话方式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:56.36,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Listening to you talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:58.17,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你的眼睛 看起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:58.17,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}your eyes, you seem
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:03:00.71,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你已经到极限了 拉斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:03:00.71,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}kind of brittle, Rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:05.12,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}过去十年里大多数时间我都烂醉如泥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:05.12,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Most of the last decade I spent stone-drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.55,0:03:08.16,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}还能动弹 但是烂醉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.55,0:03:08.16,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Functional, but hammered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:10.09,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我回了阿拉斯加
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:10.09,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Went back to Alaska,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:13.51,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}在那里待了八年 打渔 调酒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:13.51,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}spent 8 years working fishing boats, bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.51,0:03:16.66,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 我还以为你不喜欢天冷 - 我讨厌天冷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.51,0:03:16.66,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- Oh, I thought you didn't like the cold. - I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:18.10,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}2010年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:18.10,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And then I come back here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:20.47,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我第一次回路易斯安那
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:20.47,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}to Louisiana for the first time in 2010.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:21.75,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}为什么回来?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:21.75,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:25.65,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}和我现在坐在你对面的原因一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:25.65,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}The same reason I'm sitting across the table from you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:29.13,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}男人不会忘了他欠得债
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:29.13,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}A man remembers his debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.31,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我不喜欢细数过去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.31,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I don't dwell on the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:35.87,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那感觉一定很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:35.87,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, it must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.87,0:03:39.17,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不管你认为你欠我什么 我都不感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.87,0:03:39.17,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm not interested in whatever it is you think you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.63,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我不欠你什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.63,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, I don't owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:43.99,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}而是我们有事没做完
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:43.99,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We left something undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:45.94,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们必须做完
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:45.94,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We got to fix it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.61,0:03:48.46,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我这两年一直在忙这事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.61,0:03:48.46,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and I've been working on this for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:49.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我 一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:49.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Me, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:52.17,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}从来没找过你 没麻烦过你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:52.17,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Never called you, I never bothered you with it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:54.70,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你怎么可能找我 操 你都做了些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:54.70,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, why would you? Shit, man, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:57.07,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你疏远你生命中的每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:57.07,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Alienate every other person in your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:59.65,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}最终又回来找我?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:59.65,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and then finally you came back to me in the rotation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:00.66,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我不是要指责你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:00.66,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You know, not for nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:02.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但是如果你当时没干掉勒杜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:02.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but if you wouldn't have clipped Ledoux back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:04.88,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}也许我们已经把整件事弄清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:04.88,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}we might have got the whole fucking story out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.61,0:04:10.21,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我把酒喝完就走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.61,0:04:10.21,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You know, I think I'm gonna finish this beer and say so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:12.23,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我最近已经不怎么喝酒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:12.23,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Now, I'm not much of a drinker nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:15.37,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}事实上 遇到你之前我已经三周没喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:15.37,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}In fact, I hadn't had a drop in 3 weeks till I ran into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:17.46,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我不需要你喝酒 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:17.46,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, I don't need you to drink, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:19.76,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 我需要你帮我 - 我为什么要帮你?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:19.76,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- I need you to help me. - Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:21.90,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们说你无法证明自己在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:21.90,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}They say you can't account for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:24.30,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}并且有目击证人看到你在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:24.30,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}They got eyewitnesses placing you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.30,0:04:26.29,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}查尔斯湖犯罪现场出现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.30,0:04:26.29,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}at the Lake Charles crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:29.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你有个仓库却不肯让他们查看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:29.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You got some storage shed that you won't let them look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.19,0:04:30.50,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 没错 - 为什么不?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.19,0:04:30.50,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- That's right. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:33.04,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}为什么不跟他们合作? 你是清白的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:33.04,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why not shoot straight with them? You're innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:34.89,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}别让他们再浪费时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:34.89,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Help them stop wasting their time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:36.03,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}从什么时候开始
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:36.03,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Fucking since when did guilt
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:38.44,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}由州警察部门决定谁清白谁有罪了?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:38.44,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and innocence define the State PD, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:40.36,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}去他妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:40.36,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Come the fuck on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:42.46,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我不知道这事牵扯到的关系网有多大 对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:42.46,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Now, I don't know the sprawl of this thing, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:44.24,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但是我所调查的那些人 都要完了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:44.24,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}The people I'm after, they're all fucking over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:46.63,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们牵涉进了很多事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:46.63,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}They're in a lot of different things,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:48.94,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}也牵扯出了很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:48.94,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}pieces, family trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:51.37,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}只有让你亲眼看到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:51.37,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}The only way for you to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:53.43,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你才会明白我在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:53.43,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}what I'm on to here is for me to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.39,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你得来看看我查出了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.39,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You got to come see what I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:04:57.73,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不 你要知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:04:57.73,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:05:00.26,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你还没搞清楚 拉斯特
