Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.26,0:48:12.68,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Starting to think this wasn't just
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.68,0:48:15.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}老朋友的友好邀请了?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.68,0:48:15.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}a friendly invitation from an old pal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.19,0:48:16.85,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}当然是老朋友的友好邀请
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.19,0:48:16.85,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's definitely that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.19,0:48:19.75,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这么说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.19,0:48:19.75,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, then try this, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.87,0:48:22.08,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我把能想起来的全说了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.87,0:48:22.08,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I said all I remember about the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.24,0:48:25.70,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}来好好享受一下 别再问了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.24,0:48:25.70,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Let's just have a good time, and don't ask again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.88,0:48:30.31,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 我完全同意 - 好吧 
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.88,0:48:30.31,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- I'm with you 150% on that. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.82,0:48:33.44,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}问题是 史蒂夫...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.82,0:48:33.44,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Thing is, Steve...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.16,0:48:36.48,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我不会再问你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.16,0:48:36.48,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I ain't gonna ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.44,0:48:40.39,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他会
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.44,0:48:40.39,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.11,0:48:48.56,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}最好别这么做 史蒂夫
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.11,0:48:48.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No, I wouldn't if I was you, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.38,0:48:52.47,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你现在可不在你的辖区 治安官
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.38,0:48:52.47,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You're out of your jurisdiction, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.09,0:48:56.01,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你知道我现在是谁吗? 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.09,0:48:56.01,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You realize who I am now, you assholes?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.16,0:48:58.21,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}知道 不然也不会来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.16,0:48:58.21,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, I wouldn't be here if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.43,0:49:01.32,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.43,0:49:01.32,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.32,0:49:04.04,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}别看我 我从来都控制不了他
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.32,0:49:04.04,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Don't look at me. I ain't never been able to control him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.63,0:49:05.64,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}进来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.63,0:49:05.64,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.67,0:49:08.06,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}等这事完了看我怎么收拾你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.67,0:49:08.06,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}But you're done after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.14,0:49:11.88,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我会把你丢到安哥拉 用胡桃钳撕烂你屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.14,0:49:11.88,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'll have boss crackers splitting your ass in Angola.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.91,0:49:13.54,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们会聊到那事的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.91,0:49:13.54,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, we'll talk about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.16,0:49:15.44,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}还有其他事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.16,0:49:15.44,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and some other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.44,0:49:16.57,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}进来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.44,0:49:16.57,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.49,0:49:36.05,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}科尔说的那个教堂应该就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.49,0:49:36.05,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That church Cohle talked about's supposed to be right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.83,0:49:39.33,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 我们迷路了 - 我们没有迷路
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.83,0:49:39.33,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- We're lost. - We're not lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.33,0:49:41.55,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们方向正确 在往南走
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.33,0:49:41.55,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We're going in the right direction. We're heading south.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.55,0:49:43.24,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这样能走到49号公路吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.55,0:49:43.24,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And that's gonna head us to 49?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.24,0:49:44.52,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们不是在找49号公路
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.24,0:49:44.52,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No, we're not looking for the 49.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.52,0:49:45.84,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是在找教堂
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.52,0:49:45.84,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We're looking for the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.84,0:49:48.31,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我知道在找教堂 但什么教堂都没找到
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.84,0:49:48.31,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I know we're looking for the church; we ain't got to no church.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.36,0:49:50.39,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}连像教堂的东西都看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.36,0:49:50.39,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Ain't seen nothing that even resemble no church.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.39,0:49:53.06,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}连个问句话的人都找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.39,0:49:53.06,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Ain't nobody out here to even ask where anything is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.06,0:49:54.43,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}看见东西告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.06,0:49:54.43,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Let me know when you see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.43,0:49:55.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}什么东西都没
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.43,0:49:55.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}There ain't nothing to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.42,0:50:07.44,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你好 长官?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.42,0:50:07.44,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.45,0:50:09.36,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你知道这附近有个小教堂吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.45,0:50:09.36,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You know there's a little church around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.54,0:50:11.84,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}挺旧的? 牧师是黑人?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.54,0:50:11.84,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Pretty old? Black minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.89,0:50:14.02,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你一定是指生命之子 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.89,0:50:14.02,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You must mean Son of Life, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.21,0:50:16.61,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那地方关了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.21,0:50:16.61,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That place shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.64,0:50:20.72,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我记得是05年关的吧 飓风之后
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.64,0:50:20.72,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}'05, I think, just after all them hurricanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.06,0:50:24.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你住在附近吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.06,0:50:24.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You live around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.29,0:50:26.81,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不 长官 我在圣马丁住
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.29,0:50:26.81,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No, sir. I live in St. Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.93,0:50:28.37,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}签到了教区的工作合同
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.93,0:50:28.37,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Got a parish contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.37,0:50:30.48,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}照管墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.37,0:50:30.48,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Take care of some cemeteries,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.53,0:50:31.87,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}和公立学校
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.53,0:50:31.87,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}public schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.96,0:50:33.55,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}好的 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.96,0:50:33.55,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}All right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.16,0:50:36.23,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你知道从这里怎么上49号公路吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.16,0:50:36.23,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Hey, you know how to get to 49 from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.23,0:50:37.29,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}当然
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.23,0:50:37.29,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.83,0:50:40.30,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}下去不到一公里 能看见一个左转路口
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.83,0:50:40.30,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}About a half-mile, you'll see a left.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.38,0:50:42.34,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}1435大道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.38,0:50:42.34,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}PR 1435.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.50,0:50:43.54,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}走那条路
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.50,0:50:43.54,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.97,0:50:46.75,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}大概...开11公里
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.97,0:50:46.75,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}About...7 miles of fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.75,0:50:48.89,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不到克劳利 就能上49号公路
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.75,0:50:48.89,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You'll hit 49 before Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.18,0:50:50.57,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你对这里很熟悉啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.18,0:50:50.57,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Know your way around, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.57,0:50:51.96,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是的 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.57,0:50:51.96,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, yeah, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.96,0:50:55.08,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 我了解整个海岸线 我家... - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.96,0:50:55.08,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- I know the whole coast. My family... - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.48,0:51:18.99,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我家族在这里生活了很久 很久
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.48,0:51:18.99,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}My family's been here a long, long time.
